Error: Jet.ValueTypeMismatch: Service send reaches a worker that answers
  --> Tests/UI/service_send_replying_endpoint.jet:10:15
    |
 10 |     tree.send(pricing, 2) ?? return
    |               ^^^^^^^
 Why: This worker answers each message with Int, and `send` has no place for the answer
 Fix: Use `tree.call(endpoint, message)`, which returns the answer
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.ValueTypeMismatch
